SPRACHE EN
TEXTE
  1 "Copy disk"
  2 "The target disk must be formatted in the same format."
  3 "Insert the source disk."
  4 "Insert the target disk. Its contents will be overwritten."
  5 "Reading ..."
  6 "Read error on the source disk."
  7 "Not enough memory."
  8 "Writing ..."
  9 "Write error (target formatted in the same format?)."
  10 "Target disk is write-protected."
  11 "Done, disk copied."
  12 "RDDISK.MOD is missing."
ENDE
DIALOG 10 "Copy disk" 0 0 220 118
  GROUP    "Drives"      -1   8   4 204 36
  RADIO    "&A: to A:"   31  14  14  90 10 AN
  RADIO    "&B: to B:"   32  14  25  90 10
  RADIO    "A: to B&:"   33 114  14  90 10
  RADIO    "B: to A&."   34 114  25  90 10
  PROGRESS              41   8  48 204  8
  STATIC   ""           42   8  62 204 20
  BUTTON   "&Copy"       1  40  96  64 14 STANDARD
